// Halo CE enemy pack: sound aliases onto HDE sounds (no Halo audio is shipped)
$alias HCE/Melee HCES/Halo/Melee/Punch
$alias HCE/FloodPop HCES/Halo/Grenade/Frag/Explode
$volume HCE/FloodPop 0.6
$alias HCE/BodyLand HCES/Halo/Melee/Punch
$volume HCE/BodyLand 0.5

// the needler supercombine: never held back by the sound limit (several can go off at once in a crowd)
$limit HCES/Halo/Weapons/Needler/SuperCombine 0
